    <string name="horizontal_categories_vertical_app_lists">A calm home screen for Android.\n\nYour apps sort themselves into drawers on home: tap a drawer\'s name to open it, and hold an app for its shortcuts. Swipe up for every app from A to Z, left for your widgets, and right for the assistant. Hold an empty part of home, or the clock, for settings.\n\nContexts change which widgets show and which drawer opens first, by time, headphones, charging, Do Not Disturb or what\'s playing. They are checked only while home is on screen.\n\nNo ads, no analytics, no accounts. Drawers are sorted on this phone, and your choices always win. Eigen goes online for two things only: downloading an assistant model you choose, from 72F\'s mirror on Hugging Face, and Google Play, for Eigen Plus and tips. Nothing you type or search is sent anywhere.</string>
